@host = https://localhost:7092

### Login (Renata, operadora)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos.tecnico@sustennutri.com.br",
  "senha": ""
}

### Quem sou eu?
GET {{host}}/api/auth/eu
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Abrir O.S. (precisa de token)
POST {{host}}/api/ordensservico
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipamentoId": "01a13847-972e-713e-bede-ddfba54eb2b1",
  "descricaoProblema": "Teste com login",
  "prioridade": "Alta",
  "clientSyncId": "9a1b2c3d-4e5f-4a6b-8c7d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
  "criadoOffline": false
}

### Listar O.S. (sem token, deve dar 401)
GET {{host}}/api/ordensservico